#. ja: 対象のＨＰを回復する。　<ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>回復力：</ui-edge-color></ui-color>400
#. de: Du regenerierst LP des Ziels.<br>Heilpotenzial: 400
#. fr: Restaure les PV de la cible.<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Puissance<nbsp>:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 400
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
